                <pb facs="1175" n="1079" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1079"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The United States consul at Malaga reports civil governor called, expressing
                    regrets. Shield replaced. Order restored. Your course in asking due precautions
                    is approved and the prompt action of the authorities at Malaga is
                    appreciated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
